{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/8b9bcafd76a60324c87af37acb920b18.avif?t=1773071309\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start as a small-time criminal with nothing but ambition. From <strong>drug</strong> <strong>deals</strong> to <strong>hit contracts</strong>, build your reputation, expand your gang\u2019s operations, and take control of the city by completing missions for <strong>Rico</strong>, the head of your gang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/776221722a0e55620af91716f11116c6.poster.avif?t=1773071309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/776221722a0e55620af91716f11116c6.webm?t=1773071309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/776221722a0e55620af91716f11116c6.mp4?t=1773071309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore a city full of <strong>NPCs and enterable buildings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/ea533d45a0cdcfa83da43ef33ad40d26.avif?t=1773071309\" width=1560 height=244 /></span><strong>Life of Crime is an immersive crime simulator FPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use different weapons to complete the jobs you are given. Some jobs require range, some require getting your hands dirty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/6dd439c18faf15f1a61b91762f64ba69.poster.avif?t=1773071309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/6dd439c18faf15f1a61b91762f64ba69.webm?t=1773071309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/6dd439c18faf15f1a61b91762f64ba69.mp4?t=1773071309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Many different combat situations and areas to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/2b1fb3efbadbb083182a4b98970dc45a.avif?t=1773071309\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout your progression you will have your pick of <strong>many cars to keep or abandon.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/86ab3fc15002876672d780d01bc78434.poster.avif?t=1773071309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/86ab3fc15002876672d780d01bc78434.webm?t=1773071309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/86ab3fc15002876672d780d01bc78434.mp4?t=1773071309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your reputation by selling and manufacturing a <strong>variety of drugs</strong>. When rival gangs move in on your product, do whatever it takes to get it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete deals, jobs, and missions set in the day or the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Progress through <strong>story missions</strong> and <strong>side quests</strong> as you carve your path from small-time thug to city kingpin.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061040?t=1773071309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/6a47f2c94e5d8b06b3daf9dc3d27d6bc2e9d8781/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773071309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/7d65ab20d02cbe59cb34a98e6725ade3039cdfc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773071309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/7d65ab20d02cbe59cb34a98e6725ade3039cdfc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773071309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game's violence is in a cartoonish, unrealistic style. "},"demos":[{"appid":4066740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/8b9bcafd76a60324c87af37acb920b18.avif?t=1773071309\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start as a small-time criminal with nothing but ambition. From <strong>drug</strong> <strong>deals</strong> to <strong>hit contracts</strong>, build your reputation, expand your gang\u2019s operations, and take control of the city by completing missions for <strong>Rico</strong>, the head of your gang